# What's Next

After parameterization is complete, the next project will focus on changing the CPU's microarchitecture.

The next step is:

RV32IMA Microarchitecture

The CPU will first be developed into a multi-cycle architecture, allowing hardware such as the ALU to be reused across multiple clock cycles.

This will prepare the processor for the later 5-stage pipeline implementation.
